  "description": {
   "en": "“Beat me, and I’ll introduce you to a cute girl.”\n“I’ll win.” (said without hesitation)\n\nTsutomu is a game streamer desperate for romance.\nWhile his natural gaming talent keeps his viewers entertained,\nHe suddenly finds himself completely destroyed during one of his streams.\n\nThe culprit? The wildly popular vtuber Yuzuzu.\nThough he’s a powerhouse in both gaming skills and looks…\n…Sometimes he can be unexpectedly cute? (what a softie)\n\nThe gap between his cool black-haired exterior and true self is dangerously addictive!\n[An ass-obsessed, hopeless game streamer x A skilled, dominant vtuber]\n\nA complete remake of the previously published #Koibito Kakin, now reimagined for the Reiwa era!\nLet the ultimate romance game begin!"
  },
